        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Rewrites the <code class=\"notranslate\">@supports font-format</code> example to fix the mistake.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">src</code> is a descriptor exclusive to <code class=\"notranslate\">@font-face</code>, not a property that can be set.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Initially <a href=\"https://typo.social/@pixelambacht/115441236943309738\" rel=\"nofollow\">reported on Mastodon</a> by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/RoelN/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/RoelN\">@RoelN</a></p>",
