        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143106292?u=b3c5814362982b570863d2bb4e99cc0cc32ec862&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add<code class=\"notranslate\">graphics-document</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">graphics-object</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">graphics-symbol</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">ARIA</code> roles.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">These changes ensure that the reader are aware of the 3 graphical ARIA 1.0 roles. And ensures that MDN is up to date!</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">None.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #28707.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1862135707\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/28707\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/28707/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/28707\">#28707</a></p>\n",
